gemini-commander (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show menu filters: All Files, Programs, Custom (masks such as *.cpp;*.h,
    hide what .gitignore ignores); branch view and directory sizes follow them
  * Find Files and Copy can skip what .gitignore files ignore
  * Copy dialog: Count button for the number and size of files to copy
  * Large files are copied in the kernel; SHA-256 verification is optional
  * Editor: current line background (qcodeedit 1.12.0)
  * A menu closed with Escape gives the focus back at once

 -- Andrzej Borucki <borucki.andrzej@gmail.com>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0200

gemini-commander (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace KTextEditor with qcodeedit; Qt6 only, no KDE Frameworks or Qt5 build
  * Open and save files in their own encoding (UTF or code pages such as cp1250)
  * Editor status bar: position, line breaks, encoding, language, tab width
  * Setting for the language of files not in UTF-8
  * Breeze Light/Dark default theme, Kate-style gutter, Kate-like word wrap
  * Go to Line/Column remembers this session's positions

 -- Andrzej Borucki <borucki.andrzej@gmail.com>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

