gemini-commander (1.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * Dual-pane file manager with Qt6 and KDE Frameworks 6
  * Archive support via libarchive and unar
  * UDisks2/D-Bus device detection
  * Built-in text viewer with KTextEditor
  * Hex viewer widget

